Check the metadata of the model loader before its conversions
Fold-into: upstream/loader

The defects. tests/fuzz/core/run.sh test replays the reproducer of each one.

- The loader leaks the metadata context when get_key throws.

  The loader reads general.architecture with get_key before it puts the ggml context of the
  metadata in its list. get_key throws for a key of the wrong type, and the context then leaks.

  The change: The loader puts the context in its list first (the file path and the FILE path).

  The reproducer: tests/fuzz/core/regress/fuzz_model_load--loader-meta-leak.

- The loader stores general.file_type in llama_ftype with no range check.

  The loader converts general.file_type to llama_ftype with no range check.

  The change: A value above LLAMA_FTYPE_GUESSED keeps the guessed type.

  The reproducer: tests/fuzz/core/regress/fuzz_model_load--loader-ftype-enum.

Base: llama.cpp commit c6824a9 with the patches of patches/series above this one.

